      "source": "Derive a default bean name for the given <a href=\"Bean.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Bean</code></a> method,\nproviding the <a href=\"Bean.html#name()\"><code>name</code></a> attribute specified.",
